\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.7}{\ignorespaces Architectures and workflow investigated during the implementation of the routing model. Blue blocks represent inputs, green blocks denote processing stages, and orange blocks correspond to classification outputs.}}{77}{figure.caption.31}%
