\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.10}{\ignorespaces The U-Net architecture, illustrating the encoder-decoder structure with skip connections that merge high-resolution features from the contracting path with upsampled features in the expansive path. This design is highly effective for precise medical image segmentation.}}{82}{figure.caption.34}%
